# Component Building Rules

**Scope:** Astro components in `apps/website`, `packages/devtools`, and `packages/ui`. Works with `.cursor/rules/architecture.mdc` and `.cursor/rules/behaviour-escalation.mdc`.

## packages/ui vs apps/website

- **`packages/ui`** — All core UI components, grouped correctly. Buttons, inputs, NavLink, cards, icon wrappers, etc. No app logic, no CMS, no data fetching. Stateless primitives only.
- **`apps/website`** — Layout, containers, modules, and logic binding only. Follows behaviour-escalation (server first, islands, minimal JS, Alpine last). Modules compose from `packages/ui` and receive props from containers. Layout (BaseLayout) lives in website — it binds composition.

**Rule:** Website contains no core UI — it imports from `packages/ui` and binds data. Core UI lives in `packages/ui`.

## Design system usage

- **Import:** Layouts import `@rotate/design-system/design-system.css`. Components do not import CSS directly.
- **Colors:** Use semantic tokens via `var(--color-*)`. Examples:
  - `--color-background-default-primary`, `--color-content-default-primary`
  - `--color-border-default-primary`, `--color-action-brand`
- **Typography:** Use `@utility` classes from design-system:
  - `title-style1-*` … `title-style4-*` (100–1000)
  - `body-style1-*` … `body-style3-*`, `longform-style1-*`
  - `thumbnail-title`, `thumbnail-description`
- **Spacing:** Use `--spacing-*` (100–1300) or `--spacer-spacer-*` (100–800) for layout.
- **Grid:** Use `--grid-default-gutter`, `--grid-default-margin`, `grid-cols-12`, `gap-x-[var(--grid-default-gutter)]`, `px-[var(--grid-default-margin)]`.

## Styling conventions

1. **Tailwind + design tokens:** Prefer Tailwind utilities that map to design-system vars (e.g. `text-[var(--color-content-default-primary)]`, `bg-[var(--color-background-default-primary)]`).
2. **No arbitrary values for design tokens:** Do not hardcode colors, fonts, or spacing that exist in the design system.
3. **Responsive:** Breakpoints are `--breakpoint-tablet` (768px), `--breakpoint-desktop` (1024px). Use `theme(--breakpoint-*)` or Tailwind `tablet:` / `desktop:`.
4. **Theming:** Root uses `data-theme="light"` or `data-theme="dark"`. Colors use `light-dark()` for automatic switching.

## Component patterns

- **Module components** (`*.astro`): HTML + styling only. Props from container. No data fetching, no domain logic. Referentially transparent.
- **Containers** (`*.container.astro`): Server-only. Fetch data via `@rotate/cms`, validate, pass props to module.
- **Base components:** Stateless UI primitives. No app/domain logic. Minimal JS only for essential interactions.

## HTML & accessibility

- Use semantic elements (`<section>`, `<article>`, `<nav>`, `<header>`, `<footer>`, `<main>`).
- Provide `alt` for images. Use `aria-label` for icon-only controls.
- Form controls: associate labels, support keyboard navigation.

## CSS-first

- Prefer CSS solutions (e.g. `:has()`, `peer`, `group`, `@media`) over JavaScript.
- Transitions: use `transition-*` with `duration-*` and `ease-out` / `ease-in-out` from design system where applicable.

## Zero-JS default

- Components ship zero JavaScript unless essential (e.g. form validation, modals). Prefer native HTML (`<details>`, `<dialog>`) and CSS where possible.
- **Behaviour escalation:** See `.cursor/rules/behaviour-escalation.mdc` — server first, then Server Island, then minimal JS, then Alpine only as last resort.

